"id":160692918,"discussion_id":"25f8acab6356e13c69cc82bb16236e9443b3b8df","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-01-21T14:25:33+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-21T14:25:33+08:00","user":{"id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","login":"ansen-changan","object_id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","name":"hid71829882","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/ansen-changan"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160692922,"discussion_id":"157648415b8347d1a96934b81889366b7627c65c","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n ansen-changan, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-01-21T14:25:34+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-21T14:25:34+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160692931,"discussion_id":"c02e2f8c858d6143cd4db862e98da2dca6b5a0be","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-21T14:25:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-21T14:25:35+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160693022,"discussion_id":"d18d28a7f525793af4c384e0af9f08cbd7fea2b0","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在优化Flash Attention梯度计算内核中`SubGrapB`函数的执行顺序，以解决潜在的数据竞争和同步问题。原实现中，数据拷贝和格式转换操作在SinkToken求和计算之前执行，可能导致后续数据写入操作依赖不正确的中间结果，影响计算的稳定性和正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n核心修改是将`SubGrapB`函数末尾的数据拷贝（`DataCopyPad`）及相关NZ格式转换逻辑，从SinkToken求和计算之前移动到计算之后。具体调整了`copyOutOffset`计算、`DataCopyParams`设置、`ND2NZ`格式转换及`DataCopyPad`等代码块的位置，确保它们在`*dsinkSumLocal += localDsink.GetValue(0);`语句执行完毕后才执行。此调整保证了依赖SinkToken求和结果的后续操作能获得正确的输入，消除了数据不一致的风险。","created_at":"2026-01-21T14:26:06+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-21T14:26:06+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160693036,"discussion_id":"2c283899b460ff40c0f90a252eba2964a52f97dd","body":"流水线任务触发成功，任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=0d4f52bd3a494432a028df25bc3297f8&pipelineRunId=55033a23be8b4faca04d8f6e1d3b72c5&projectName=CANN'>55033a23be8b4faca04d8f6e1d3b72c5</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>codecheck</strong></td>\n                            <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                            <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckDashCode/MR_22c0e034c08d427680311aa7a549cbce/1e51c527331cce07171df1b62d117573?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                            <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        </tr> \n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>SCA</strong></td>\n                            <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                            <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/personalScandTaskInfor/person/4f929de1-9bb6-414e-a70b-819e2380d951?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                            <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        </tr> \n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>anti_virus</strong></td>\n                            <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                            <td><a href=https://www.o